<title>SINGAPORE: Material Handling in China paging jv.</title>
<headline>Material Handling in China paging jv.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Material Handling Engineering Ltd (MHE) said on Wednesday it signed a memorandum of understanding (MOU) with a Chinese partner to form a foreign joint venture company to provide paging services in China.</p>
<p>The MOU was signed with Chengdu Tongfa Telecom Co Ltd.</p>
<p>MHE said in a statement it intended to hold a 40 percent stake in the proposed joint venture company. The joint venture was for a 20-year duration.</p>
</text>
